# Education first

On the homepage and the downloadable PDF, **Education is the first body section** after the name / label / summary header.

Never place Experience, Selected work, Projects, Skills, Awards, GitHub, Links, or Contact above Education.

## Required order

1. Header (name, label, summary)
2. **Education**
3. Experience
4. Selected work / Projects
5. Everything else

## Do not

```tsx
// BAD: Experience before Education
<Section title="Experience">...</Section>
<Section title="Education">...</Section>
```

```tsx
// GOOD
<Section title="Education">...</Section>
<Section title="Experience">...</Section>
<Section title="Selected work">...</Section>
```

## Notes

- One Education entry: Eastern Washington University. Keep it linked (`viewHref` on the site).
- Dates: **2022-2027** (started college in 2022, Bachelor of Science expected 2027). Do not use the 2025 transfer year as `startDate`.
- Do not add the University of Montana as a school, transfer line, or second Education row on the homepage or PDF.
- `resume.json` field order does not matter. Render order in `HomePage.astro` and `scripts/export-resume.mjs` does.
- Copy can still lead with systems / Wawona. Section order still starts with Education.
